  "notes": "STRICT_DNS and LOGICAL_DNS clusters carry an inline ClusterLoadAssignment whose cluster_name must match the cluster. Host endpoints retain priority and locality identity; the target builds priority and locality paths and applies the CDS endpoint policy, including xds_wrr_locality when configured. DNS clusters request no EDS subscription. Native tests cover decode acceptance/rejection, SotW publication, delta publication, endpoint reprojection and absent EDS subscriptions."
